WEBVTT

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:04.520
Summer has arrived at Fumizuki Academy.

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:09.610
'Tis the season for the sun to burn bright above and for water to splash this way and that.

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:20.360
Oh, yes, and nosebleeds as well.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:31.790
Something that grows when its alone, What is it?

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:33.070
One more chance, One more chance!

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:34.450
Never, Never give up!

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:35.750
One more chance, One more chance!

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:37.050
Never give up!

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.180
Meeting with someone else is easy

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:52.950
I decided what to say before they even asked

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:55.560
My heart beats fast thinking if I passed or not

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.740
I can't panic in this fight for love

00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:00.810
Study! Study! Study! Keeps me up all night

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.440
I've got a dreaming genius inside me

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:06.020
I'd be great if everyone's wishes came true

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.190
I won't care about other people's lives

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:11.150
Perfect-area complete!

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:13.780
I'll definitely be waiting for you!

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:20.180
I can hear your voice from the Perfect-area!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.490
Ah! Ear! Ear!

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:24.760
Why? Why can't stop when I pass you

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:27.370
if I'm your counselor

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:29.960
"Are we friends?" Yes, we're friends."

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:31.960
But, I failed the test with a 0

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:35.270
No! I'll take it again! and again!

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:37.410
I'm serious. One more chance, please

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:41.880
There's something better for is in the future

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:47.970
Better than my life right now.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:57.040
Sixth Period
Me and Pool and Swimsuit Paradise and.

00:01:57.040 --> 00:01:58.720
Oh right, Yuuji.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:01:59.470
What?

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:04.440
They cut the gas, so there's only cold water.

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:06.770
Why couldn't you have told me that <i>before</i> I went in, you bastard!?

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:07.730
Sorry, dude.

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:10.650
Start with your limbs, since they're the farthest from the heart,

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:11.970
and then slowly move inwards...

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:14.570
Look, man, I didn't ask you how to take a damn shower with cold water!

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:16.700
What the hell is your problem?

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:18.990
Oh, I know! Take a cold shower and you'll calm down in a jiffy!

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:21.910
That's why I'm pissed off to begin with, you dipshit!

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:27.630
Christ, man, your gas is off and you have nothing that could even be considered edible.

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:29.400
Seriously, how the hell are you still alive?

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.580
That's rude.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:32.460
I do have something that could be considered edible.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.010
You'll get plenty of calories from those.

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:37.010
I'm not really into drinking salad oil.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.510
Look at the fridge, man. It's totally empty.

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:42.190
That's rude. It's not empty.

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:44.350
Whatever, I'll just use this to calm myself down.

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:47.710
So which ones are yours?

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:49.940
The coke, coffee, ramen, and the chilled Chinese noodles.

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:53.400
You asshole! You're gonna force me to eat the damn chopsticks, are you!?

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.620
Wait, you're serious?

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:58.200
Well, they're more edible compared to the inorganic plastic bag.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:00.270
You're not getting any chopsticks.

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:03.160
There's no way I'm gonna eat this with my hands.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:05.750
Hey, don't worry, I brought some stuff for you too.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.850
Diet coke, konjac jelly, and agar.

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:10.580
I can't get any calories from these!

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:13.750
Hey, I'm trying to be thoughtful here. I don't want you to get fat.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:16.670
I don't think that's something I need to worry about!

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.630
Well, all you're taking in is sugar and fat.

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:21.680
Because that's all I eat!

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.180
Now I'm getting pissed!

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:25.640
What? You wanna go?

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:26.830
Sure.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:29.600
I've been planning to settle the score with you anyway.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:32.360
Great. Same here.

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:48.460
It's in my eyes!!

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:50.670
Not bad...

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.380
You too...

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:54.880
But I'm just getting started!

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:56.960
I'm not going to go easy on you!

00:03:59.380 --> 00:03:59.970
The staff enjoyed the food after this.

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:02.940
I don't think this really accomplished much...

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:04.310
Yeah...
The staff enjoyed the food after this.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.880
Damn, I'm all sticky now...

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:08.410
Gotta take a shower...

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.000
You first, Yuuji.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.560
I'd have to be out of my friggin' mind.

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.980
Then what are you going to do?

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:16.850
I'm gonna find somewhere with hot water.

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:20.070
I see.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:25.490
So that is your excuse for trespassing, using the showers, and changing into your swim trunks?

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:27.870
Is there anything else you would like to add?

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.290
It's all his fault!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.830
It's your fault for not bringing me anything to eat!

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:34.460
No, it's your fault for not paying your gas bills!

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:36.630
I'll be fine as long as there's water!

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:38.340
I bet your water doesn't even work right!

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:41.160
Enough. I think I understand now.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:43.260
Exactly! It's not my fault!

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.940
I understand now that both of you are on a totally different level of intelligence!

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:51.890
You will be coming here next weekend to clean the pool as punishment!

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:52.540
Yes, sir...

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.810
That's pretty harsh.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:59.150
I'm not looking forward to cleaning a pool that big...

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:00.920
Don't say that.

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:04.910
Didn't he say that we'd get to use the pool as much as we wanted in return for cleaning it?

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:06.740
Voyeur, wanna come help?

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:07.530
I'll pass.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.830
By the way, I'm inviting Himeji and Shimada too.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.620
I'll bring the brushes and detergents.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:15.510
Sounds like fun.

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:18.810
May I come? I want to help out.

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:19.420
Of course!

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.340
Hey, what are you guys talking about?

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:22.340
It sounds pretty interesting.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.670
The pool's reserved for us this weekend.

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.050
Want to come along?

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:31.180
Pool... That means swimsuits, right?

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:34.250
I'll have to wear my swimsuit...

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:35.900
Akihisa Vision

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:36.560
Oh yeah, Hideyoshi is coming along so he can show his swimsuit to Akihisa.

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.080
How do I look?

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:39.570
Oh yeah, Hideyoshi is coming along so he can show his swimsuit to Akihisa.

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:41.250
That's cheap, Kinoshita!

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:42.950
You might be confident, but...!

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:45.610
I agree! You're not being fair!

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:47.740
What are you even talking about?

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.620
So, are you two coming or not?

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:50.190
Yes!

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.220
Of course!
Yes!

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:52.810
I've got a lot of prep to do.

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:56.040
You're right. Preparing properly is important.

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.750
I need to lose some weight...

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:02.170
All right, now I just need to tell Shouko about it.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:03.850
You're inviting Kirishima?

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:06.090
So you've finally become a man.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:10.910
Akihisa, if Shouko finds out after the fact,

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:12.350
just what do you think will happen to me?

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:14.770
I'm sorry.

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:17.940
Morning, guys!

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.350
Good morning, Yoshii.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.070
I'm glad the weather's so fabulous today.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:25.280
I bought a new swimsuit for today's sake.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:27.030
What type?!

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:28.530
Trunks.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.930
Those are for guys!

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:31.950
I am disappointed.

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.770
I can't believe you, Hideyoshi.

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:35.290
Do you hate me that much?

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:38.170
Why exactly am I the one at fault here?

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:41.560
Good morning, Mr. Stupid!

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:42.550
Hazuki...

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:45.670
She forced me to bring her.

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.890
Now that we're all here,

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:50.970
let's get changed and meet at the poolside.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.390
Okay!

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:55.220
Hey, come on.

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:57.070
This is the guys' side.

00:06:57.070 --> 00:06:59.230
You and Hideyoshi need to use the other side.

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:01.120
I was just messin' with ya!

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.980
I was not.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:06.570
Come on, you two. Stop playing around.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:08.280
You too!?

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:12.490
No! I can't go into the girls' room by myself!

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.990
If you dare change in front of Yuuji...

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.910
What's wrong with you people?

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.980
Don't worry, Hideyoshi.

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:19.670
Look.

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:20.460
Male Changing Room

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:22.630
Female Changing Room

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:23.130
Hideyoshi Changing Room

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.450
So "Hideyoshi" is a gender in and of itself...

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:26.050
Hideyoshi Changing Room

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:32.180
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:34.140
Oh, Hazuki-

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:42.680
Isn't this a felony?

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:44.480
I want to call my lawyer.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:47.320
You guys are getting turned on by an elementary kid in a swimsuit?

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.660
Hey, Hazuki!

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:52.820
Give those back! Seriously!

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.820
Oh, oops...

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:56.370
Breasts...

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:02.420
Don't play around with these!
They cost me an arm and a leg!

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:06.510
Aren't those breast pads-

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:08.360
Christ!

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:12.160
You saw nothing! You saw absolutely nothing!

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:16.560
Of course not! I saw nothing! Nothing at all!

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:22.430
Someone press the shutter for me...

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:30.370
It took me ages to save up for those... Hazuki, you idiot!

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:32.530
What are you looking at?

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:33.820
Is something funny?

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:36.790
Nah, you look great.

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:38.170
Seriously?

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:43.970
Your breasts, bust, and bazongas are very slender, and really-

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:45.460
You just cracked my toe!

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:48.960
Did you just call me flat three times fast?

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:50.950
No reason to get mad about it.

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:54.470
He might not show it, but he really does like how you look in that swimsuit.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:59.470
Oh, you silly! You don't need to hide your true feelings from me!

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:02.840
Okay, I won't. Your breasts are really small.

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:04.940
I'm going to rupture your eyes.

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:23.220
My eyes...! My eyes...!

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:26.260
This is so you won't look at other girls.

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:28.840
You're beautiful.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:31.760
I thank you deeply for the compliment.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.090
Yuuji, you've got something to tell her yourself, right?

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:38.010
Shouko...

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:44.170
Get me some tissues... my eyes won't stop leaking...

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:45.910
She meant what you think about her swimsuit.

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:47.730
How am I supposed to tell her that when I can't even see!?

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:52.470
Man, Yuuji's such a dork. Right, Voyeur?

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:53.150
Huh?

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:54.820
Voyeur!

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:58.700
Sorry, I'll be leaving first...

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.660
God dammit! Who?

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:03.120
Who did this to Voyeur?!

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:10.140
Sorry! Tying the ribbons on the back took a lot of time...

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.270
Blood loss reaching critical levels!

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:15.640
Is this... a biological weapon?

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:20.140
Yoshii?! What's wrong?

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:30.480
What happened to Minami?

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:34.400
Sometimes she lapses into German when she's upset.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:37.590
What's going on? What happened?

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:41.740
No looking.

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:43.930
Is this everyone?

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:46.160
Nope, Hideyoshi isn't here yet.

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:48.210
I wonder what he's going to wear.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:49.500
Trunks.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:50.960
Oh yeah...

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.200
Sorry for taking so long.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:57.720
Dead

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.540
The blood just keeps on coming...
Dead

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:00.850
Kill me now.
Dead

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:03.270
We're all here, right?

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:07.210
Kinoshita, do you have a grudge against us or what?

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:08.230
Traitor!

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:10.690
You make these promises then turn right around and stab us in the back!

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:13.380
You're really cute, miss!

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:15.620
Can't you tell that I'm a guy?

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.860
But you're wearing a girl's swimsuit!

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.320
What?!

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:22.160
I told the sales clerk I wanted normal trunks!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.790
Honestly, I think most people would think you're a girl at first glance.

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:29.200
Yuuji, are your eyes okay?

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.750
Don't worry, they're slowly recovering...

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:35.170
There are too many things you don't need to see here.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:38.010
Give me liberty or give me death! Now!

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:38.620
There are too many things you don't need to see here.

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:48.840
Take this!

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:54.360
Shouko... Sh-Shouko...

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:59.150
You're so good at swimming, Yoshii!

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.610
You're not going to join me?

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:03.720
Well, to tell the truth, I don't know how to swim.

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:05.320
I can only float.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:07.470
I'll teach you.

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:08.740
I'm pretty good at swimming.

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.240
Really? Thank you!

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:16.160
Usually it's the other way around - the A rank helping out the F rank with her studies.

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:20.000
I guess Minami's the A and Himeji's the F right now!

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:24.050
Look closer! I'm at least a B!

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:29.180
By the way, Yuuji, I'm a C.

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.300
What are you talking about?

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:36.170
Hey, let's play Waterdevil.

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:39.640
Waterdevil? Is that like playing cops and robbers in the water?

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:41.090
Nope.

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:44.970
In Waterdevil, the person who's "it" chases the other people,

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:48.830
and they win if they manage to drown them!

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:51.170
Yeah, that sounds devilish, all right!

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:54.580
It's pretty dangerous, too, though.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:55.700
I don't think it's a good idea.

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:57.500
You won't let me?

00:12:57.780 --> 00:13:00.420
Watch this. Kirishima!

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:03.790
What is it?

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:06.710
You should play Waterdevil with Yuuji.

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:08.460
The rules are simple.

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:14.140
To win, all you need to do is drown Yuuji and then give him CPR afterwards.

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:24.440
Someone... Someone save me!

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:32.360
See? It's dangerous.

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:40.370
You told her to do it!?

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:43.220
You're so stubborn...

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:45.540
Let go of me! I've never done anything to you!

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:47.250
Huh? Rep?

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:49.420
Aiko?

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:52.630
Aren't you Kudou from class A? What are you doing here?

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:54.720
I'm on the swim team.

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:55.930
Someone else came too.

00:13:57.610 --> 00:14:04.200
Sissy! Why didn't you tell me you were going to the pool?!

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:05.690
Why the hell are you here?

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:12.280
I have special informants that help me protect you from these horrible, disgusting pieces of garbage!

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.370
I'm going to get changed.

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:19.700
By the way, don't get caught if you're going to peek.

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:23.150
She just told us to go for it.

00:14:24.350 --> 00:14:26.630
I'm not a man if I don't go.

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:31.550
You'll need to be prepared for the consequences if you want to do that, Yoshii.

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:34.970
Do you want to go home in a hearse?

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:38.950
Somehow, this seems like a bad idea...

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:43.320
In the interest of personal safety, I'll let Voyeur's camera handle the mission.

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:46.520
God dammit!

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:52.370
Man, I'm hungry after all this swimming.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:54.650
I brought something with me.

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:59.580
I forgot how many people were coming, though, so I didn't mention it...

00:15:01.930 --> 00:15:04.460
I made three waffles this morning.

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:06.000
Welcome to the first annual...

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.860
...speediest of all competition!

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:09.780
It's a battle of life and death!

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:11.380
Yeah!

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:14.380
The rules are simple.

00:15:14.380 --> 00:15:17.720
One lap around the pool. The first person to finish wins!

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:23.100
Himeji made three poisonous waffles. We have four contestants.

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:28.680
The contestant who wins will be spared from eating the waffles, and thus live to tell the tale.

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:33.990
Let's begin.

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.950
Ready...

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:38.370
Voyeur just lost a lot of blood...

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:42.620
and I can't see myself losing to Hideyoshi in terms of physical fitness.

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:44.040
Get set...

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.380
That means...

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:47.790
...I have only one enemy.

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:49.710
Start!

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:53.170
Bring it!

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:55.220
Spare me the cheap tricks!

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.080
My thoughts exactly!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.850
You ain't half bad, Akihisa.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.810
It's gonna take more than this to beat me!

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:04.590
You guys probably shouldn't bother fighting right now.

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:06.060
The other two contestants are already on the return trip.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:09.680
Oh shit! I'm gonna lose!

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:10.890
This is bad.

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:13.820
I'll take care of Voyeur! You take care of Hideyoshi!

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:14.150
Okay!

00:16:17.570 --> 00:16:20.490
You're not getting past me!

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:34.210
Huh?

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:35.400
What's this?

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:37.160
Aki!

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:39.590
Yoshii, what are you doing?!

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:43.770
Wait... Isn't this...

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:47.230
Isn't this Hideyoshi's...

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:49.160
W-What?

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:53.590
Yoshii!

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:54.430
Aki!

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:56.030
Kinoshita, cover up your chest!

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:58.950
Why should I!? I'm a guy!

00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:04.300
I have no regrets.

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:07.970
This is going to be a pain to clean up.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:13.010
That was fun.

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:13.340
Yup.

00:17:13.890 --> 00:17:16.420
I feel like I'm gonna pass out any second now.

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:18.550
It's probably due to anemia, not fatigue.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:20.160
He's right.

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.300
Feel like going for a bath?

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:23.390
I'm in!

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:28.260
Hey, come on.

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:29.740
This is the guys' side.

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:31.790
You and Hideyoshi need to use the other side.

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:33.840
I was just messin' with ya!

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:35.650
I was not.

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:39.240
Come on, you two. Stop playing around.

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.760
Not this again!

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:44.160
I can't go into the women's bath by myself!

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.270
Don't worry, Hideyoshi.

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:47.040
Look.

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:48.140
Bath
Male

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:49.060
Bath
Female

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:50.060
Hideyoshi Bath

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:56.170
So it's already caught on...

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:00.160
This is great.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:01.510
Nice and warm...

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:05.960
What's the matter, Voyeur?

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:07.980
The girls are on the other side of the wall.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:08.850
What?!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:11.850
What are you doing?

00:18:11.850 --> 00:18:13.770
It's legal! Legal!

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:16.750
Let's wash each other!

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:18.920
Everything that happens in a bathhouse is legal.

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:21.610
What do you mean? What do you want to do?

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:47.810
Umm... Having big breasts isn't really that great.

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.560
Your shoulders ache. It's a real pain in the neck.

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:51.640
That's what they all say!

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:03.890
Akihisa, pass the shampoo.

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:04.610
Here.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:07.710
Isn't this the soap I bought?

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:11.440
Well, it can still foam up, so I figured I didn't need to buy any more.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:14.050
I am such an idiot for asking you.

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:17.040
Hey, Shouko. Pass me your shampoo.

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:19.300
Thanks.

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:23.620
Yuuji, pass me the soap.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:24.450
There.

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:30.390
It's like you two are already married!

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:33.170
S-Shut up, Himeji!

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:34.660
You don't wanna know what'll happen if she takes that remark seriously!

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:36.190
There's something wrong-

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:54.040
No! Stop!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:58.160
Sissy, it simply makes no sense to wear a towel inside a bathhouse!

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:01.920
Take that thing off and have some <i>fun</i> with me!

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:03.880
Why is it always me!?

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:16.520
Hey, did you know?

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:19.060
The bathtubs in bathhouses are all connected.

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:22.510
A butt?

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:26.650
Maybe you'll be able to see something if you dive under the water.

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:28.110
Let's try this!

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:30.070
HOT!

00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:32.870
That's where the hot water comes in!

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:34.620
We need to coat ourselves with cold water first!

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:36.960
Let's try this again!

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:39.920
Jesus Christ! My fucking eyes!

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:42.840
How unfortunate.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.660
God damn it... She won't get away with this!

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:46.510
She'll pay for this!

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:49.430
I'll see it no matter what it takes!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:55.120
With this iron bracelet, it is possible to summon a Being without a teacher's permission.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:56.850
Awaken!

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.030
Summoning Being...

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:00.050
Summon!

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:04.190
Go!

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:08.950
It's Mr. Stupid's Being!

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:10.320
Can you see?

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:14.280
My Being can see it, but I don't feel the least bit excited!

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:16.200
This.

00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:20.580
That's right! If I give my Being a camera...

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:22.040
Summoning Being...

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:27.800
Summon!

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:33.320
This isn't a very good idea!

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:36.470
There's no way your Being is
getting past this line of defense.

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:38.740
Just you watch!

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:39.890
Go!

00:21:41.470 --> 00:21:44.160
Oww...

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:53.490
Those who have been KIA will receive supplementary lessons!

00:21:53.570 --> 00:21:55.910
Why the hell is Ironman here?

00:21:56.230 --> 00:21:56.320
Wait, what the hell were you doing there?!

00:21:56.320 --> 00:21:58.830
Man, he just can't catch a break.
Wait, what the hell were you doing there?!

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:02.390
Oh, I won.

00:22:09.610 --> 00:22:18.680
Baka, go go home!

00:22:18.970 --> 00:22:21.950
It's a time of peace now that school's out

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:23.500
If I were to compare her

00:22:23.500 --> 00:22:25.040
"She's a real angel!"

00:22:25.040 --> 00:22:28.010
Then a sudden note ruined my fun

00:22:28.010 --> 00:22:29.400
It said I have a makeup test!

00:22:29.400 --> 00:22:30.790
It's hell!

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:34.130
I was joking with my friends,

00:22:34.130 --> 00:22:37.160
"There's no way someone is that stupid!"

00:22:37.160 --> 00:22:40.240
But deep down inside,

00:22:40.240 --> 00:22:41.530
I was screaming,

00:22:41.530 --> 00:22:44.490
"That was me! I'm that stupid!"

00:22:44.910 --> 00:22:51.070
I thought the "Monthly" sign in the parking lot

00:22:51.070 --> 00:22:56.350
was the company's name!

00:22:56.350 --> 00:22:59.100
For the longest time...

00:22:59.800 --> 00:23:02.800
Stupidity is a manly character

00:23:02.800 --> 00:23:05.500
Is that our lack of common sense?

00:23:05.500 --> 00:23:08.810
Rules are useless in this world

00:23:08.810 --> 00:23:11.810
Eat Korean BBQ every night and overthrow the masses!

00:23:11.810 --> 00:23:13.450
Look!

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:18.020
The sun that rose from the west is now setting down.

00:23:18.020 --> 00:23:21.060
Run! It's almost dinner time.

00:23:21.060 --> 00:23:27.930
Let's go home!

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:37.070
Question 7:

00:23:37.070 --> 00:23:41.020
What is the legal age for marriage, as stated in the Japanese Civil Code?

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:43.500
Age doesn't matter as long as you're in love.

00:23:43.500 --> 00:23:45.600
Thank you for having dreams and aspirations.

00:23:45.600 --> 00:23:47.820
Next episode: Me and Shouko and Kisaragi Grand Park.

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:49.860
This will be on your test.
